ent-StatueStoneCUP = stone tea statue
    .desc = A stone statue depicting a tea-drinking revolutionary. It stands as a symbol of unity and shared purpose among comrades.
ent-StatueOneYearAnniversary = monument to the first year
    .desc = A marble statue of an idealized employee, made to commemorate the first anniversary of NanoTrasen control over the Starlight Sector.
        While ostensibly celebratory, it seems oddly mournful. Many died to make this possible.
ent-Phoronic = phoronic cascade
    .desc = A huge structure made of pure plasma. Dark energy roils and bursts within it.
ent-EndymionStatueLarge1 = Small Endymion Memorial
    .desc = A memorial commissioned in 2143 to commemorate the lives lost aboard the Endymion and Blu-E, carved from a recovered fragment of the ships' hull and shaped into their likeness. The names of the lost crew are carved on it.
        "In reaching to the future, we must never forget those who came before us."
        - TSF representative Kennedy Sunderland
ent-StatueAngel = statue of an angel
    .desc = An ancient marble statue. The subject is depicted with flowing robes and wide spread wings.
